        "filing_date": "2026-02-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We sell our products and services through direct sales organizations in the U.S., Europe (excluding Italy, Spain, Portugal, Greece, and Eastern European countries), China (through our majority-owned joint ventures, Intuitive Surgical-Fosun Medical Technology (Shanghai) Co., Ltd.",
